{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":43,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的唯一救主"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"雅各啊，以色列啊，创造你、使你成形的耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“不要害怕，因为我已经救赎了你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我点名呼召了你，你属于我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你穿越洪涛，我必与你同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你渡过江河，必不会被水淹没；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在火中走过，必不会被烧伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火焰不会烧到你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我是你的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列的圣者，是你的救主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用埃及作你的赎价，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使古实和西巴代替你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我珍视你，看重你，深爱你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我用他人代替你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用列邦交换你的生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要害怕，因为我与你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必从东方带来你的子孙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从西方召集你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要对北方说，‘交出来！’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对南方说，‘不要扣留！’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要从远方把我的儿子们带来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从地极把我的女儿们领回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有属于我的人都要回来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为自己的荣耀创造了他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他们成形并塑造了他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“要把那些有眼看不见、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有耳听不见的人带出来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让万国聚集，列邦会合。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们哪个神明曾启示这事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁预先向我们显明要发生的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们可以找证人来证实，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫听见的人都说这是真的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘以色列人啊，你们是我的证人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我拣选的仆人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要叫你们认识我，相信我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白我是耶和华。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以前没有上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以后也没有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我，唯独我是耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外没有别的救主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾启示，我曾拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们中间没有别的神明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是上帝，你们是我的证人。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我从太初就是上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人能逃脱我的手。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能逆转我所做的呢？’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你们的救赎主耶和华——以色列的圣者说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“为了你们的缘故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必派大军进攻巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使迦勒底人坐着他们引以为荣的船逃亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是你们的圣者耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列的创造主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你们的君王。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华曾在大海中开道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在大水中辟路径。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使埃及的战车、马匹、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"军兵和勇士倾巢而出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们一同倒下，不再起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像熄灭的灯火一样灭没。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“不要想念过去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要缅怀往事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我要行一件新事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这事现在就要发生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你们没有察觉吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在旷野辟道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在沙漠开江河。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"野兽必尊崇我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中有豺狼和鸵鸟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我使旷野有甘泉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠有江河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供我拣选的子民饮用。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们是我为自己所造的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要颂扬我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"“雅各啊，你却没有求告我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，你竟然厌烦我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你没有带来作燔祭的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有用祭物来尊崇我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有让你因祭物而受累，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有让你因香料而烦扰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你并没有花钱买菖蒲献给我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有用祭物的脂肪满足我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"反而使我因你的罪恶而受累，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你的过犯而烦扰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"“我，唯独我为自己的缘故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除去你的过犯，忘掉你的罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你尽管提醒我，你我可以理论，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你可以提出理由证明自己的清白。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的始祖犯了罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的首领也背叛了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要羞辱你圣殿的官长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使雅各遭毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列受辱骂。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":28}